    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, I’m… I’m fine.”</span> He blushes a little as he takes a drink. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, guess I did get a little carried away there. He’s just so-!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> grunts, unable to find the words. You smirk and ask if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> makes him jealous. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No, I’m not jealous I just-!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> pauses turning redder before turning away pouting like you’ve seen your little brother do. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Maybe a little, but only because he is just so full of himself. Thinking he’s some big monster or something.”</span> He sighs, taking another drink before turning to you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But- but what did he mean when he said you were swimming naked and that he played with you-?”</span> <br>

